<title>USA: CSL Lighting Q1 net loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>CSL Lighting Q1 net loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>VALENCIA, Calif. 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>CSL Lighting Manufacturing Inc Wednesday reported a net loss for the three months ended March 31, 1997 of $395,000 or $0.05 a share, as compared with net income of $3,000 in the prior year period.</p>
<p>Net sales for the latest quarter were $3,198,000 as compared with $3,367,000 in the comparable year-ago period.</p>
<p>The results in the first quarter include a $246,000 charge, or $0.03 a share, relating to the company's financing consummated in February 1997.</p>
